# Website language: English only

This project is the **Buconero Apps** marketing and help website (`index.html`, `legal.html`, `help/*.html`, and related assets).

## Rules

- Write **all user-facing text in English**: navigation, headings, body copy, buttons, `aria-label`s, meta descriptions, placeholders, and legal/help sections unless the user explicitly requests another language for a specific block.
- Set `lang="en"` on the root `<html>` element for every page.
- Keep **app product names** as branded (e.g. Card Grading AI, Book Writing AI, Card Centering Pro).
- Do not introduce Italian (or other languages) for UI copy when adding or editing pages.
- Privacy policies and store-linked content may stay in English; align tone with existing help pages.

## File scope

- `index.html` — homepage
- `legal.html` — legal notice
- `help/*.html` — per-app help (privacy, delete account, support)
- `styles.css` / `script.js` / `nav.js` — no user-facing Italian in comments intended for the site

When the user asks for new sections or copy, default to clear, professional English suitable for an international app audience.
